{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SpectralSequence","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Quotient.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.page_stabilises_of_collapse","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.page_stabilises_of_collapse","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PagedSpectralSequence.lean#L127-L147","doc":"**The theorem the old API could not state.**\n\nIf `S` collapses at `r₀` then at every cell of page `r ≥ r₀` the next page\nis isomorphic to this one. In `QOU/Mathlib/SpectralSequence.lean` the\ncorresponding claim was `eInfinity_eq_page_is_rfl` — true by definition,\nfor every spectral sequence, collapsing or not.\n\nThe proof is the content of collapse: `d_c = 0` makes the kernel\neverything, and `d_{prev c} = 0` makes the incoming image nothing, so the\nquotient is the page itself. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.Collapses","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.Collapses","kind":"def","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PagedSpectralSequence.lean#L122-L125","doc":"Collapse at `r₀`: every differential from page `r₀` on is the **zero map**\n— not \"equals a nominated element\". ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.PagedSS.turn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.PagedSS.turn","kind":"def","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PagedSpectralSequence.lean#L116-L116","doc":"**Page-turning**: `E_{r+1}^{p,q} ≅ ker d_r ⧸ im d_r`. This is the law\nthat makes the pages a sequence. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.PagedSS.d_comp_d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.PagedSS.d_comp_d","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PagedSpectralSequence.lean#L113-L113","doc":"`d ∘ d = 0`. Absent from the old API, and without it the page quotient\nbelow is not well-posed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.PagedSS.d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.PagedSS.d","kind":"def","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PagedSpectralSequence.lean#L110-L110","doc":"The differential `d_r : E_r^{p,q} → E_r^{p+r,q-r+1}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.PagedSS.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.PagedSS.mk","kind":"ctor","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PagedSpectralSequence.lean#L107-L107","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.PagedSS","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.PagedSS","kind":"structure","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PagedSpectralSequence.lean#L99-L117","doc":"**A spectral sequence with the laws that make collapse mean something.**\n\nPages are `R`-modules; the differential is `R`-linear and squares to zero;\nand `turn` is the page-turning isomorphism `E_{r+1} ≅ ker d_r ⧸ im d_r`.\n\nThe `page` family and its module structure are *parameters* rather than\nfields, which keeps the laws free of the `@`-instance gymnastics that\nbundling would force. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.incoming","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.incoming","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PagedSpectralSequence.lean#L87-L97","doc":"The subobject of `ker d_c` cut out by the image of the incoming\ndifferential. Well-formed whether or not `im ⊆ ker`; `d_comp_d` is what\nmakes it the intended quotient. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.reindex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.reindex","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PagedSpectralSequence.lean#L81-L85","doc":"Transport a page along an equality of cell indices. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.next_prev","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.next_prev","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PagedSpectralSequence.lean#L72-L79","doc":"`next ∘ prev = id`. Holds by arithmetic on `ℤ`, **not** by `rfl` — which is\nwhy the incoming differential needs the transport below rather than\ntype-checking directly. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.bump_r","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.bump_r","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PagedSpectralSequence.lean#L70-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.prev_r","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.prev_r","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PagedSpectralSequence.lean#L68-L68","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.CellIndex.bump","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.CellIndex.bump","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PagedSpectralSequence.lean#L64-L66","doc":"The same bidegree on the next page. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.CellIndex.prev","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PagedSpectralSequence.CellIndex.prev","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PagedSpectralSequence.lean#L59-L62","doc":"Source of the differential landing in `c`: `d_r : E_r^{p-r,q+r-1} → E_r^{p,q}`.\nInverse to `CellIndex.next`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}